  "result": "I changed `archiveIssuesForProject` in `src/server/repositories/issue-repository.ts` so the cascade only touches live issues. Its `WHERE` clause now includes `livePredicate(issues.archivedAt, {})`, which restricts the update to rows where `archived_at IS NULL`.\n\nThis fixes all three symptoms. Already-archived issues keep their original `archived_at`, the returned count covers only issues archived by the cascade, and the `project.archived` event carries that count into the audit log, the activity summary, and the `issuesUsed` decrement. Issues in other projects are still excluded by the project and org predicates.\n\nI haven't run the test suite.",
